---------------------------------------+----------+----------
 pg_temp_statistic                     | t        | t
 pg_temp_statistic_relid_att_inh_index | t        | t
 tmp1                                  | t        | t
 tmp1_c_seq                            | t        | t
 tmp1_pkey                             | t        | t
